<p><span class="intro-txt"><strong>Sorry we can't find that page.</strong></span></p>
<p><br><span class="intro-txt">No matter; we’ll get you where you need to go</span>.</p>
<p><span class="intro-txt" style="margin-top: 20px;">You can search our website below or head to our <a href="/" title="AlixPartners.com">homepage</a>.</span></p>
<p><span class="intro-txt" style="margin-top: 20px;">If you arrived here from a link on our website, please <a href="/get-in-touch/website-query/" title="Website support">let us know about the error</a>.</span><span class="intro-txt" style="margin-top: 20px;"></span></p></div><!--]--></div><div class="ap-grid-2column"><!--[--><!--]--></div><!--]--></div><div class="ap-grid search-page-content" items-number="1" style="margin-bottom:35px;" displayresults="true" alias="searchBuilderElement" data-v-77024ac0><!----></div><div class="mx-auto my-[26px] h-[1px] w-full max-w-[1225px] bg-black" data-alias="divider-element" style="" alias="dividerElement"></div><div class="ap-grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-4" style="margin-top:0px;" alias="twoColumns7525"><div class="ap-grid-2column-75"><!--[--><div class="rte" style="" alias="richTextEditorElement" gridimgtransformation="9" data-v-fc137d8b><p><span class="intro-txt">People typically come to AlixPartners for these things:</span></p>
<ul>
<li><span class="intro-txt">They want to take advantage of a shift in their industry or new market opportunity.</span></li>
<li><span class="intro-txt">They aren’t sure how to use the resources at their firm, but know they need to adapt.</span></li>
<li><span class="intro-txt">They’re facing a critical moment and need actionable insight, fast, from industry insiders.</span></li>
</ul></div><!--]--></div><div class="ap-grid-2column-25"><!--[--><!--]--></div></div><div class="ap-grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3" style="" alias="threeColumns"><!--[--><div class="ap-grid-3column"><!--[--><div class="content-card-large" style="" alias="contentCardElement"><div data-v-2fe2af5c><a href="/our-people/" aria-label="  Find a consultant" title="  Find a consultant" target role="link" class="group mx-auto block max-w-[1225px] overflow-hidden transition-all duration-100 lg:hover:scale-[1.04]" data-v-2fe2af5c><!--[--><article class="card-cta-action mb-[35px] reversed is-content-card !mb-0" data-v-2fe2af5c><div class="card-cta-img-gradient absolute -inset-1 z-[2] card-cta-img-gradient-black" data-v-2fe2af5c></div><div class="card-cta-img-bg-layer absolute -inset-1 z-[2] card-cta-img-bg-layer-black" data-v-2fe2af5c></div><img src="https://cdn.cloudinary.com/alixpartners/image/upload/t_Search_Tile_Overlay/t_tile_4/v1695989095/Imagery/OurPeople_z1ecbw" alt loading="lazy" width="600" height class="card-cta-img" data-v-2fe2af5c><div class="card-cta-action-content z-10" data-v-2fe2af5c><div class="facet-label-day-row flex items-center justify-between print:block" data-v-2fe2af5c><div><!----></div><!----></div><div class="card-cta-action-h-and-p-desktop card-cta-action-h-and-p" data-v-2fe2af5c><p class="card-cta-action-h with-border" data-v-2fe2af5c><span class="line-clamp-4 print:line-clamp-6" data-v-2fe2af5c>Find a consultant</span></p><div class="card-cta-action-p h-[56px]" aria-hidden="true" tabindex="-1" data-v-2fe2af5c><span class="line-clamp-4 print:line-clamp-6" data-v-2fe2af5c>Many of our people have led teams in industry . We bring experience and seniority to every project.</span><span class="mb-2 mt-1 hidden text-blue print:block" data-v-2fe2af5c>https://www.alixpartners.com/our-people/</span></div></div><div class="card-cta-action-h-and-p-mobile" data-v-2fe2af5c><h2 class="h4 card-cta-action-h-mobile" data-v-2fe2af5c>Find a consultant</h2><svg width="1